{"id":"n52937-1-9","stage":3,"title":"만원 · 满座","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52937-1-9-1","ko":"왜 오늘 수업에 지각을 한 거야?","zh":"为什么今天上课迟到了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"수업에","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업에","audio":"/audio/db0846a81dcf81aae77c.mp3"}},{"text":"지각을","meaning":"迟到","explanation":"지각：迟到；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지각","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91667","senseId":"1","lemma":"지각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지각을","audio":"/audio/e41ba7843a0469fd1a8a.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"4415e2551a08952b","term":"지각","zh":"迟到","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3","entryId":"91667","definition":"比规定时间晚上班或上学。","pronunciation":["지각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/32ec40f8e41abc255fad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52937-1-9-2","ko":"오는 지하철마다 모두 만원이라 제때에 탈 수가 없었거든.","zh":"因为每趟地铁都挤得水泄不通，所以没能及时上车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오는","meaning":"来，开来","explanation":"오다：来，开来；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"3","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철마다","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철마다","audio":"/audio/278589ccc78a52a8d2a7.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"만원이라","meaning":"满座，人员满额","explanation":"만원：满座，人员满额；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"만원","audio":"/audio/f425bbe9b3e290cdfdc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52937","senseId":"1","lemma":"만원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만원이라","audio":"/audio/c4ae22ea3e373d4cee91.mp3"}},{"text":"제때에","meaning":"按时","explanation":"제때：按时；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제때","audio":"/audio/b2c5d061f9a68cf5e3be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75558","senseId":"2","lemma":"제때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제때에","audio":"/audio/0712da4cf38a5d426a89.mp3"}},{"text":"탈","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탈","audio":"/audio/a61623942ca7dcd47cdf.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없었거든.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었거든","audio":"/audio/9e24a34e5a9d75331ca0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，开来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"交通工具朝着某个基准的地方运行。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3","entryId":"71490","definition":"行驶在地下铁路的电动车。","pronunciation":["지하철"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"f425bbe9b3e290cd","term":"만원","zh":"满座，人员满额","audio":"/audio/f425bbe9b3e290cdfdc9.mp3","entryId":"52937","definition":"在某个空间，挤满可容纳人数。","pronunciation":["마눤"]},{"id":"b2c5d061f9a68cf5","term":"제때","zh":"按时","audio":"/audio/b2c5d061f9a68cf5e3be.mp3","entryId":"75558","definition":"规定的时候。","pronunciation":["제때"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce215d5b323eff8babdb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=52937","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为每趟地铁都挤得水泄不通，所以没能及时上车。","公公婆婆现在似乎已经对你敞开心扉了吗？","为什么今天上课迟到了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为每趟地铁都挤得水泄不通，所以没能及时上车。","为什么今天上课迟到了？","公公婆婆现在似乎已经对你敞开心扉了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
